{"doc": "Caesar-style shift of a string: characters of the chosen class (lower, upper, alpha = both cases, digit) are moved by amount positions with wraparound (alphabet size 26, digits 10); amount may be negative or huge; backward reverses the direction; all other characters are unchanged. One pass via a translation table, O(n).", "complexity": "n", "role": "shifted", "drives": ["seq"], "requires": [], "generator": [{"kind": "string", "chars": "abcxyzABCXYZ 0189,!"}, {"kind": "value", "value": 3}, {"kind": "value", "value": "lower"}, {"kind": "value", "value": false}], "sizes": [10000, 100000], "tests": [{"args": ["abc", 1, "lower", false], "expected": "bcd"}, {"args": ["xyz", 3, "lower", false], "expected": "abc"}, {"args": ["Hello, World!", 0, "lower", false], "expected": "Hello, World!"}, {"args": ["abc", 29, "lower", false], "expected": "def"}, {"args": ["abc", -1, "lower", false], "expected": "zab"}, {"args": ["", 5, "lower", false], "expected": ""}, {"args": ["Abz9", 1, "alpha", true], "expected": "Zay9"}, {"args": ["a9z", 2, "digit", false], "expected": "a1z"}, {"args": ["aXz", 1, "upper", false], "expected": "aYz"}]}
